                                   "title":  "Sonatine (1993 film) - Wikipedia",
                                   "snippet":  "Sonatine (Japanese: ソナチネ, Hepburn: Sonachine) is a 1993 Japanese yakuza film directed, written and edited by Takeshi Kitano, who also stars in the film. It won numerous awards and became one of Kitano\u0027s most successful and praised films, garnering him a sizable international fan base.",
